:TESTCASE-BEGIN:1
:DESC: Test case to test EVPN IMET Routes Installation 

:PRINT: Topology to be loaded cross_link_topology()

:PRINT:
:PRINT:
:PRINT:                                                                               +--------+-+
:PRINT:                                                +---------+                    | R2       |
:PRINT:                                            eth1| R1      |eth2     20.1.1.2/24|122.1.1.2 |eth8      
:PRINT:                                    +-----------+122.1.1.1+--------------------+          +-------------------+
:PRINT:                                    |10.1.1.2/24|         |20.1.1.1/24     eth3|          |50.1.1.1/24        |
:PRINT:                                    |           +---------+                    +-----+--+-+                   +
:PRINT:                                    +                                          eth4/  |eth7                   |
:PRINT:                                    |10.1.1.1/24                       30.1.1.1/24/   |40.1.1.2/24            |
:PRINT:                                    |eth0                                        /    |                  eth9 |50.1.1.2/24
:PRINT:                                 +---+---+--+                                   /     |                  +----+-----+                    +-------+                +-----+
:PRINT:                                 |          |                                  /      |                  |    R3    |eth1      v10(Trunk)|       |eth2        eth1|     |
:PRINT: +------+v10(Trunk)          eth1|   R0     |                                 /       |                  | 122.1.1.3+--------------------+       |----------------| H3  |
:PRINT: |      |+------------------------+122.1.1.0 |                               /        |                  |          |AC-v20          eth0|  CE2  |v10  172.168.0.3|     |
:PRINT: | CE1  | eth0             AC-v10|          |                               /         |                  +----+-----+                    |10.0.0.2|               +=====+
:PRINT: |10.0.0.1|                      +---+---+--|               ---------------/          |                       |eth10                     +---+---+
:PRINT: +--+---+                            |eth14                /                          |                       |60.1.1.1/24                   |eth1
:PRINT:    |eth1                            |80.1.1.1/24         /                           |                       |                              |v10
:PRINT:    |v10                             |                   /                            |                       |                              |
:PRINT:    |                                |                  /                        eth6 |40.1.1.1/24            |                              |
:PRINT:    |172.168.0.1/24                  |             eth5/30.1.1.2/24             +-----+----+                  |                              |172.168.0.2/24     
:PRINT:    +-+-+                            |           +----/----+                    |   R4     |                  |                           +--+---+
:PRINT:    +-H1|                            |      eth15|   R5    |eth12    70.1.1.2/24|122.1.1.4 |eth11             |                           |  H2  |
:PRINT:    +---+                            +-----------+122.1.1.5|+-------------------+          +------------------+                           +------+
:PRINT:                                      80.1.1.2/24|         |70.1.1.1/24    eth13|          |60.1.1.2/24                                
